error[VLT0115]: method-call syntax is retired
  --> retired_method_call.vlt:23:7
   |
23 |   d = s.len(1)
   |       ^^^^^
  = help: application is juxtaposition, so write `recv.len args` with no parentheses and no commas. Doc 87 §1.2: `x.f y` is `f(x, y)`, the receiver first — row 99 wave 3 inverted the `.` that plan 57 §1.1 had made field-access-only, and the parenthesised form is the one spelling it did not take

